WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023908 — Episode 29 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-26 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.710
I'm fine, just a little shaken.

2
00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.710
Thank the gods.

3
00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:20.650
You're in one piece.

4
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.860
At least he kept you safe.

5
00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.560
But what could take him down?

6
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.260
He's the strongest of us all.

7
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.760
The Oracle Flower caught me in its vines.

8
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.660
I couldn't break free.

9
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.460
Talon came for me.

10
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.260
He saved me.

11
00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.560
It must be the mate bond.

12
00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.860
That's what got to him.

13
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:40.660
What?

14
00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.060
He found his mate?

15
00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:42.960
Who?

16
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.960
Right before the Oracle Flower was destroyed,

17
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:53.400
I asked it to show me my mate.

18
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.600
It showed me Talon,

19
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.340
which means I'm his mate.

20
00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:00.840
What exactly did you see?

21
00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:04.180
Does Talon even know about this?

22
00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:06.980
I sent him to the Oracle to find his mate.

23
00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:07.880
And he did.

24
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.080
Dragon blood and dragon air.

25
00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.880
Tradition always finds its way.

26
00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.980
So that's why Talon came.

27
00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.880
He was looking for his mate this whole time.

28
00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.780
He came for Naomi,

29
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.180
not me.

30
00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.080
Talon's unstable right now.

31
00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.180
If I'm his mate,

32
00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:27.500
I should be the one there when he wakes.

33
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.900
Very well.

34
00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:29.900
Naomi,

35
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.900
you'll move into Talon's residence tonight.
